          "mediastreamin_test.go"
        ]
      }
    },
    "media-stream-out": {
      "name": "media-stream-out",
      "title": "Media stream out",
      "description": "The plumbing for media the server streams out: producers run one at a time per session and can be cut off as a whole, and what was sent is kept so a connection joining part-way is replayed. The base the speech output kits build on.",
      "tier": "core",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "path": "go/kits/mediastreamout",
      "tags": [
        "media",
